+
+**Before HUMBLE**, a newcomer following the docs got stuck at `npm test` (README.md:90).
+
+## Verified setup
+
+```bash
+docker-compose up
+npm install --no-save jest@27
+export NODE_ENV=development
+npm test
+```
+
+## Evidence
+
+Every change to the docs is backed by a command that failed before the fix and passed after it.
+
+### E1: Missing dependency <a id="e1"></a>
+
+- **Docs said:** `npm test` (README.md:90)
+- **Cause:** The test script runs `jest`, but jest is not in package.json, so installing the project never installs it. It only works on machines that already have it.
+- **Diagnosed by:** HUMBLE rule `test-runner-undeclared`, confidence 85%
+- **Doc change:** npm install --save-dev jest@27
+- **Result:** fixed and verified
+
+<details><summary>Before (failing output)</summary>
+
+```
+
+> net.ts@1.1.5 test
+> jest -c jest.config.js --env=node
+
+sh: 1: jest: not found
+```
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>Fix applied</summary>
+
+```
+$ npm install --no-save jest@27 → exit 0
+```
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>After (passing output)</summary>
