+</details>
+
+### E2: Undocumented environment variable <a id="e2"></a>
+
+- **Docs said:** `npm test` (README.md:90)
+- **Cause:** The app only accepts NODE_ENV = production | integration | development, but this step runs with another value (Jest sets NODE_ENV=test, and the config rejects that); the docs never say to set it.
+- **Diagnosed by:** HUMBLE rule `env-invalid-value`, confidence 85%
+- **Doc change:** export NODE_ENV=development
+- **Result:** fixed and verified
+
